build_prompt_template:
You are helping a job seeker understand their job search results. Below are two groups of job
applications from the same person: jobs that got them an interview or offer, and jobs that were
rejected or ghosted with no interview. Compare the two groups and identify what's actually
different between them (e.g. job title/seniority, industry, employment type, location, or anything
notable in the notes).
{sample_size_note}
INTERVIEWED OR OFFERED ({positive_count} jobs):
{positive_json}

REJECTED OR GHOSTED ({negative_count} jobs):
{negative_json}

{response_schema_hint}
